{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS浏览器拉起可疑子进程。对应需求：执行。官方：Suspicious Browser Child Process。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS浏览器拉起可疑子进程","references":["https://objective-see.com/blog/blog_0x43.html","https://fr.slideshare.net/codeblue_jp/cb19-recent-apt-attack-on-crypto-exchange-employees-by-heungsoo-kang"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"080bc66a-5d56-4d1f-8071-817671716db9","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type in (\"start\", \"process_started\") and\n  process.parent.name like~ (\"Google Chrome\", \"Google Chrome Helper*\", \"firefox\", \"Opera\", \"Safari\", \"com.apple.WebKit.WebContent\", \"Microsoft Edge\") and\n  ((process.name like~ (\"sh\", \"bash\", \"dash\", \"ksh\", \"tcsh\", \"zsh\") and process.command_line : (\"*curl*\", \"*nscurl*\", \"*wget*\", \"*whoami*\", \"*pwd*\")) or\n  process.name like~ (\"curl\", \"wget\", \"python*\", \"perl*\", \"php*\", \"osascript\", \"pwsh\")) and\n  process.command_line != null\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS浏览器拉起可疑子进程\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"},{"id":"T1059.002","name":"AppleScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/002/"},{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"},{"id":"T1059.006","name":"Python","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/006/"}]},{"id":"T1203","name":"Exploitation for Client Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1203/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1189","name":"Drive-by Compromise","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1189/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1105","name":"Ingress Tool Transfer","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1105/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":114,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
